The KiCad board reader is written from KiCad's published file-format
documentation (https://dev-docs.kicad.org/en/file-formats/); no KiCad code
is included.

The Circuit JSON adapter reads and writes the format defined by the
circuit-json package (https://github.com/tscircuit/circuit-json, ISC), which
it uses at run time; no circuit-json code is included. Polygon unions use
polygon-clipping (https://github.com/mfogel/polygon-clipping, MIT) at run
time; none of its code is included.
